# BUBU voice — young American lady via on-device Termux TTS (Google TTS).
# No cloud, no API key needed. Optional tuning:
# BUBU_VOICE_ENGINE=com.google.android.tts BUBU_VOICE_LANGUAGE=en-US BUBU_VOICE_PITCH=1.15 BUBU_VOICE_RATE=1.05
# On the phone, set Google TTS voice to a young US female:
# Settings > System > Languages > Text-to-speech > Google TTS > Voice > English (US), young female.